<title>USA: Silicon Storage in repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Silicon Storage in repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Storage Technology Inc said its board approved a stock repurchase program of 1,000,000 shares.</p>
<p>The repurchase program is expected to continue until June 17, 1997, unless extended or shortened by the board.</p>
<p>The company said it expects industry overcapacity to continue. It said overcapacity in the past few quarters has resulted in higher than normal price declines in its markets, which has unfavorably impacted our revenues, gross margins and profitability during recent quarters.</p>
<p>It said it expects this situation may continue for some time before it gets better.</p>
</text>
